planation": "Stored secrets are never shown back. Blank means leave it alone; only typing a new value replaces what is stored."}, {"id": "q4", "text": "A listing shows as Unmapped. What happens to orders for that SKU?", "options": [{"id": "q4a", "text": "They are rejected until the listing is mapped", "isCorrect": false}, {"id": "q4b", "text": "They import, and their lines arrive without a part until you map the listing", "isCorrect": true}, {"id": "q4c", "text": "They import onto the Direct channel", "isCorrect": false}, {"id": "q4d", "text": "They are held on the storefront", "isCorrect": false}], "explanation": "A marketplace order is already paid for, so it always imports. Mapping the listing later fills in the part on those earlier lines too."}, {"id": "q5", "text": "A buyer asks you to delete their personal information. What does Scrub personal details do?", "options": [{"id": "q5a", "text": "Deletes the buyer and all their orders", "isCorrect": false}, {"id": "q5b", "text": "Removes name, email, phone and addresses but keeps orders and totals", "isCorrect": true}, {"id": "q5c", "text": "Hides the buyer from the list until they order again", "isCorrect": false}, {"id": "q5d", "text": "Moves the buyer to the Customers list", "isCorrect": false}], "explanation": "Scrubbing removes the identifying details permanently and cannot be undone. The orders, counts and totals stay so history and analytics still add up."}]}"""
